  Slug: acupuncturist
  DisplayName: Acupuncturist
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Access Tian Xia origin You've studied qi and its abilities to heal
    the body through assessment and regulating qi flow. You know occult techniques
    that originated in Chu Ye before its masters were driven away when oni took over.
    You might have encountered a master willing to teach an eager student or felt
    the relief of its practice on your own body, taking your interest to greater
    heights. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Wisdom or Dexterity , and
    one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in Medicine and Acupuncture Lore.
    You gain the Battle Medicine skill feat.
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Lost Omens Tian Xia Character Guide
